{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55691","headline":"寄题明月禅院（之二） · 赞宁","name":"寄题明月禅院（之二）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积翠湖心迤逦长，洞台萧寺两交光。\n鸟行黑点波涛白，枫叶红莲橘柚黄。\n人我绝时偎树石，是非来处接帆樯。\n如何遂得追游性，摆却营营不急忙。\n（见范成大纂《吴郡志》卷三十三。\n）（按：《吴郡志》录赞宁诗二首，题作《寄题水月禅院》。\n然同卷云：水月禅院，「天佑四年，刺史曹珪以『明月』名之，皇朝祥符间诏易今名。\n」院名「水月」，在赞宁死後，克据旧名改题。\n其一已收入《全唐诗补逸》卷十八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赞宁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}